###    IOT AGENT CALLS



### CYGNUS VERSION
curl http://owsei.ddns.net:81/cygnus/v1/version \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}' 


### ESTADO DE EL IOT AGENT
curl http://localhost:81/iot-json-admin/iot/services \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}' \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "fiware-service: pamplona" \
  -H "fiware-servicepath: /urbanmobility" \
  -d '{
    "services": [{
      "apikey": "123456789abcd",
      "cbroker": "http://localhost:1026",
      "entity_type": "vehicle",
      "resource": "/iot/json"
    }]
  }'


